<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Chocolatey package for the Nexa SQL MSI installer. Version and checksum are rendered by
     packaging/render-manifests.ps1 from the released assets. -->
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>nexa-sql</id>
    <version>@VERSION@</version>
    <title>Nexa SQL</title>
    <authors>SosomLab</authors>
    <owners>kiros33</owners>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 SosomLab (Sangyong Bae)</copyright>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-sql</projectUrl>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-sql/tree/main/packaging/choco</packageSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-sql/tree/main/docs/wiki</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-sql/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-sql</projectSourceUrl>
    <!-- CDN with a pinned tag; raw.githubusercontent.com is not accepted by moderation. -->
    <iconUrl>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/SosomLab/nexa-sql@v@VERSION@/packaging/branding/nexa-sql-256.png</iconUrl>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-sql/blob/main/LICENSE.md</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <tags>nexa-sql sql sql-client database oracle sql-server postgresql sqlite cli cross-platform</tags>
    <summary>Lightweight cross-platform SQL client (IDE) with the nsql CLI</summary>
    <description>
Nexa SQL is a lightweight SQL client and IDE for Oracle, SQL Server, PostgreSQL and SQLite
that looks and behaves the same on Windows, macOS and Linux. It is a single executable
written entirely in Rust and draws its own UI with a built-in CPU rasterizer - no Qt,
WebView or Electron, and no runtime dependencies.

Highlights:

- Object explorer with metadata search and object details
- SQL editor with code completion, object hyperlinks and a SQL formatter
- Result grid with filters, sorting, in-place data editing and SQL/CSV/JSON export
- Transaction control, session variables in the SQL*Plus style, bulk import/export
- `nsql` command-line client for scripts and automation

The package installs the MSI for all users (GUI `Nexa SQL` plus the `nsql` CLI).
Oracle connections need an Oracle Instant Client installed separately.

License: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 - free for noncommercial use only; commercial use
is not permitted under this license.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-sql/releases/tag/v@VERSION@</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
